n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin\\left(x+\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\right)&=\\sin x\\cos\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\right)+\\cos x\\sin\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\left(0\\right)+\\cos x\\left(-1\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\cos x.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe requested coefficients are $0$ and $-1$, respectively. A negative coefficient goes inside its blank."] [:db/add "3dd24ddd-f58f-58c4-8fcf-ecf0cffb1c6e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "3dd24ddd-f58f-58c4-8fcf-ecf0cffb1c6e" :question/answer-fields "c231e2e3-a26b-5f46-b33e-76623bd7db6b"] [:db/add "3dd24ddd-f58f-58c4-8fcf-ecf0cffb1c6e" :question/answer-fields "6d4c2008-5b6d-5f90-8e15-9dd7a11a863c"] [:db/ensure "3dd24ddd-f58f-58c4-8fcf-ecf0cffb1c6e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059820 :knowledge-point/questions "3dd24ddd-f58f-58c4-8fcf-ecf0cffb1c6e"] [:db/add "d2e94e2f-5bf8-5623-ada0-d524c6059dda" :answer/id #uuid "d2e94e2f-5bf8-5623-ada0-d524c6059dda"] [:db/add "d2e94e2f-5bf8-5623-ada0-d524c6059dda" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d2e94e2f-5bf8-5623-ada0-d524c6059dda" :answer/value "-1"] [:db/ensure "d2e94e2f-5bf8-5623-ada0-d524c6059dda" :answer/validate] [:db/add "db3216d2-2473-56e0-b8f0-b6b757c4f8ec" :answer-field/id #uuid "db3216d2-2473-56e0-b8f0-b6b757c4f8ec"] [:db/add "db3216d2-2473-56e0-b8f0-b6b757c4f8ec" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "db3216d2-2473-56e0-b8f0-b6b757c4f8ec" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "db3216d2-2473-56e0-b8f0-b6b757c4f8ec" :answer-field/choices "d2e94e2f-5bf8-5623-ada0-d524c6059dda"] [:db/add "db3216d2-2473-56e0-b8f0-b6b757c4f8ec" :answer-field/correct "d2e94e2f-5bf8-5623-ada0-d524c6059dda"] [:db/ensure "db3216d2-2473-56e0-b8f0-b6b757c4f8ec" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4ff011b7-2c2d-5cc9-994b-e5954e5fc500" :answer/id #uuid "4ff011b7-2c2d-5cc9-994b-e5954e5fc500"] [:db/add "4ff011b7-2c2d-5cc9-994b-e5954e5fc500" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4ff011b7-2c2d-5cc9-994b-e5954e5fc500" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ens